              "traits": "Koraidon must match this exact strong red upright standing pose, with the small reptilian face clearly visible at the TOP and the narrow yellow eye. Preserve the white, pink and blue feather crest and the long segmented pale head tendril curving behind it. The large dark grooved chest-throat wheel is a body structure with red and white edge points, NOT a face; do not put eyes or a mouth on the wheel. Preserve both separate arms and pale pointed hand claws, the broad red-and-white standing feet, pale belly, white back spikes and long red tail with white triangular edges. Copy the exact source silhouette, anatomy, pose and gaze."
