              "traits": "Miraidon must match this exact upright floating violet-blue source pose. Preserve the small angular pale face, its separate narrow eye and the tall dark central head crest. Exactly two long head appendages branch into jagged white, violet and pale yellow ELECTRIC LIGHTNING shapes, never feathers or leaf-shaped fans. Preserve the source's pale chest with sharp cyan-white zigzag bands and the yellow border; do not replace it with a smooth oval shield or generic diagonal stripes. Keep the two separate arms with pale segmented fingers, bent lower limbs, violet body panels and the long lower curved yellow-white-violet tail and energy shapes in their exact source arrangement. The chest is not a second head."
            },
            "pokeapi:official-artwork:25": {
              "sha256": "bd2163009d392e192c134a5f1c4ccceafd5d7c57a704373c6b6be4be0091cc5f",
              "traits": "Pikachu must match this exact cheerful yellow source pose: exactly two long black-tipped ears, two separate dark round eyes with white highlights, red cheek circles and the open pink mouth with distinct tongue. Preserve the image-left arm extended outward and the image-right arm bent toward the chest with its separate small pointed finger contours. Copy the two small standing feet and one continuous large yellow zigzag tail with its brown base. Preserve the source's body proportions, expression, eye spacing, ear angles and hand pose; no extra fingers, ears, tails or facial marks. Scene-appropriate foreground overlap is allowed without changing these defining features."
            }
